; z80dasm code/data map for banks 4-6 (sound triplet @ 0x6000).
; regen-bank.sh keeps only blocks whose start falls in the 8K being disassembled.
; Banks 5-6 are packed-PSG streams (already labeled data); no extra code map.

; ===========================================================================
;  bank 4 @ 0x6000
; ===========================================================================
; AY R#7 mixer LUTs (mute / noise / tone / both per channel).
mix_lut:      start 0x6C84 end 0x6C90 type bytedata
; sound_ptr id 0 overlaps ld (9000h),a / ret at 0x6F2A (bytes 90 C9).
sound_ptr:    start 0x6F2E end 0x6FB0 type worddata
psg_payload:  start 0x6FB0 end 0x8000 type bytedata
